     *
     * <p>The method validates the size of the array and ensures that each
     * element is a {@link COSNumber}.  Non‑numeric elements cause an
     * {@link IllegalArgumentException} to be thrown.  Elements that are
     * {@code null} or {@link COSNull} are treated as {@code 0.0f}.
     *
     * @return a float array containing the numeric values of the COSArray
     * @throws IllegalStateException    if the array exceeds {@value #MAX_ARRAY_ELEMENTS}
     * @throws IllegalArgumentException if an element is not a {@link COSNumber}
     */
    public float[] toFloatArray() {
        final int sz = size();

