     * Compare {@code fromVersion} and {@code toVersion}.
     *
     * <p>The method expects both versions to be in the form {@code "x.y.z"} where
     * {@code x}, {@code y} and {@code z} are integer values. Any deviation from
     * this format results in an {@link IllegalArgumentException}. This defensive
     * approach prevents {@link ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException} and
