 * <p>This implementation mitigates deserialization attacks by enforcing a strict whitelist
 * of allowed component types. Any attempt to deserialize an array whose component type
 * is not on the whitelist results in an {@link IllegalArgumentException}. The whitelist
 * contains only primitive wrapper types, {@link String}, {@link BigDecimal},
